  "body": "Discover modern comfort at Lot 7, 20 Melia Place. This beautifully designed brand-new 3-bedroom home offers light-filled open-plan living, quality finishes, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to your own private garden - perfect for entertaining or relaxing in the sun.\r\nComplete with two stylish bathrooms and a secure single garage, this low-maintenance home is ideal for families, professionals, or investors.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Stanmore Bay living - just minutes to the beach, local schools, Silverdale Shopping Centre and with easy access to the upcoming Penlink connection.\r\n\r\nMove in, unpack, and enjoy! Contact us NOW!",
